{"kind": "daily", "period": "2026-08-09", "prepared_on": "2026-08-09", "html": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,'PingFang TC','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;color:#16213e;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#1a2b4a;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;padding-left:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\">📰 每日 AI 新聞 Top 10 · 2026-08-09</div>\n<div style=\"background:#ecf7ef;border-left:5px solid #4caf72;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#4caf72;font-weight:800;\">1.</span> Planned Amazon data center could become the biggest climate polluter in the U.S.<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#1e9e57;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">亞馬遜規劃中的資料中心恐成美國最大氣候污染源</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">As part of a planned Texas data center, Amazon is investing in an on-site power plant that could reportedly become the largest source of climate pollution in the United States.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">作為德州資料中心計畫的一部分，亞馬遜正投資興建一座自用發電廠，據報導可能成為美國最大的氣候污染源。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/08/08/planned-amazon-data-center-could-become-the-biggest-climate-polluter-in-the-u-s/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#f1ecfb;border-left:5px solid #8a6bd8;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#8a6bd8;font-weight:800;\">2.</span> OpenAI acquires presentation startup NextSlide<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6b3bf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">OpenAI 收購簡報新創 NextSlide</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">NextSlide says its team members are now working on ChatGPT.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">NextSlide 表示其團隊成員現已加入 ChatGPT 團隊工作。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/08/08/openai-acquires-presentation-startup-nextslide/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#e8f6f5;border-left:5px solid #2bb0a6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#2bb0a6;font-weight:800;\">3.</span> The first self-driving vehicle on Mars has proven to be a smashing success<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#0f9b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">研究</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">火星上首輛自動駕駛車輛證實大獲成功</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">About 90 percent of the distance driven by Perseverance has been autonomous.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">毅力號火星車約九成的行駛里程都是由自動駕駛系統完成。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Ars Technica</b> · <a href=\"https://arstechnica.com/space/2026/08/the-first-self-driving-vehicle-on-mars-has-proven-to-be-a-smashing-success/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#fbf3e3;border-left:5px solid #d99b3f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#d99b3f;font-weight:800;\">4.</span> DeepMind's hurricane breakthrough has surprised weather scientists<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b9791f;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">模型</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">DeepMind 颶風預測突破令氣象學家驚艷</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Open source WeatherNext model can make accurate predictions with lower-resolution weather data.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">開源的 WeatherNext 模型僅需較低解析度的氣象資料，就能做出精準預測。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Ars Technica</b> · <a href=\"https://arstechnica.com/science/2026/08/deepminds-hurricane-model-bought-forecasters-an-extra-day/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#fdeef0;border-left:5px solid #e0738a;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#e0738a;font-weight:800;\">5.</span> Researchers reveal hackers breach Oracle databases to attack Windows systems<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#d83a5e;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">研究人員揭露駭客入侵 Oracle 資料庫，並以其為跳板攻擊 Windows</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Security firm Huntress found compromised Oracle databases used as a springboard to attack Windows systems, exploiting SQL injection combined with Oracle's built-in Java feature to gain SYSTEM-level access and steal user passwords.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">資安業者 Huntress 發現，駭客利用傳統 SQL 注入漏洞結合 Oracle 資料庫內建 Java 功能，將攻擊工具包植入資料庫，最終取得 Windows 系統的 SYSTEM 權限並竊取用戶密碼。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/177979\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#edeefb;border-left:5px solid #6b72d6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#6b72d6;font-weight:800;\">6.</span> OpenAI says it slowed Astra model development over security concerns<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#5159c9;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">OpenAI 表示因資安疑慮而放緩 Astra 模型開發</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI said this still-in-development model reached its \"critical cybersecurity threshold,\" meaning it could independently identify and carry out cyberattacks against well-protected real-world systems.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI 表示這款仍在開發中的模型已達到「關鍵資安門檻」，意味著它能自主識別並對現實中防護良好的系統發動網路攻擊。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/08/07/openai-says-it-slowed-astra-model-development-over-security-concerns/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#e8f4fb;border-left:5px solid #3f97c9;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#3f97c9;font-weight:800;\">7.</span> What's behind the Google AI shake-up<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#2b7fb0;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Google AI 團隊人事大地震的背後原因</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Some of the biggest names on Google's AI team got new jobs this week, in some cases leaving Google entirely, raising questions about the company's position in the AI race.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Google AI 團隊多位重量級人物本週異動，部分甚至離開 Google，也讓外界質疑 Google 在 AI 競賽中的處境。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/podcast/976784/google-deepmind-ai-race-vergecast\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#f2f6e8;border-left:5px solid #88a83f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#88a83f;font-weight:800;\">8.</span> Scientists Used AI to Create 16 New Viruses<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6e8c28;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">研究</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">科學家利用 AI 創造出 16 種新病毒</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">The use of AI systems to create viruses opens new possibilities for combating bacterial resistance, but also raises concerns about technology outstripping regulation.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">利用 AI 系統創造病毒，為對抗細菌抗藥性帶來新可能，但也引發技術發展超前法規監管的疑慮。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Wired</b> · <a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/scientists-used-ai-to-create-16-new-viruses/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#f9edf6;border-left:5px solid #c56bb0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#c56bb0;font-weight:800;\">9.</span> AMD to acquire Canadian AI chip startup Taalas<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b04b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">AMD 宣布併購加拿大 AI 晶片新創 Taalas</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">AMD announced a definitive agreement to acquire Canadian AI chip startup Taalas to strengthen its AI inference technology, with the deal amount undisclosed and still pending regulatory approval.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">AMD 周四宣布已簽署最終協議，將收購加拿大 AI 晶片新創 Taalas，以強化 AI 推論技術及產品布局，雙方未公布交易金額，收購案仍須取得監管機關批准。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/177955\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#eef4ff;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#5b8def;font-weight:800;\">10.</span> Cloudflare lets websites enable WebMCP without code changes<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#3b6cf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Cloudflare 讓網站免改程式即可啟用 WebMCP，AI 代理可直接使用網站功能</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Cloudflare launched a WebMCP developer preview that auto-injects a bridge script into pages, letting WebMCP-compatible AI agents discover and call a site's functions directly, without requiring code changes.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Cloudflare 推出 WebMCP 開發者預覽版，會自動在網頁中加入橋接程式，讓支援 WebMCP 的 AI 代理能直接發現並呼叫網站功能，網站管理者無需修改既有程式即可在控制臺開啟此功能。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/177965\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:11.5px;color:#9aa1ad;padding-top:10px;\">由 AI News Digest 從各家 RSS 自動挑選、翻譯並寄送</div>\n</div>\n"}